  "description": "The Service Course Tri is enhanced with our highest-grade Studio NEXT carbon fiber and a more sophisticated carbon lay-up to reduce frame weight by 150 grams. With class-leading aerodynamics, handling, and weight, it is the ultimate do-it-all triathlon weapon.\nFrame weight: 924 grams (size M) - The Studio NEXT Service Course is one of the lightest triathlon frame options\nStudio NEXT Carbon - Our highest grade carbon fiber and most sophisticated carbon lay-up reduces frame weight by 150 grams\nExclusive premium Studio NEXT paint color options\nPaint matched one-piece aero cockpits maximize aerodynamics and aesthetics\nDraft-Legal - Standard drop-bar handlebars and a UCI-legal frame maintain eligibility for draft-legal events\nOptional Clip-On Extensions - Clip-on compatible cockpits to add extensions for middle and long distance events\nAero Headtube - Extended, narrowed, and shaped to reduce frontal area and direct air rearward\nAero Fork - All-new fork design creates efficient airflow around the front tire\nAero Downtube - Deep, aggressive shape reduces turbulence and keeps airflow attached\nWide Tire Clearance - Clearance for tires up to 36mm wide\nUDH - Universal Derailleur Hanger for serviceability and compatibility\nThreaded T47A BB - Silently increases stiffness, serviceability, and reliability",
